{"title":"Sound Engineer Roadmap","role":"Sound Engineer","summary":"Students do not need to master every DAW. One professional DAW plus familiarity with another is sufficient initially.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc Photography / Sound Engineering"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc","Audio/Sound Intern","Assistant Sound Engineer","Sound Engineer","Senior Sound Engineer","Audio Producer / Re-recording Mixer","Sound Supervisor / Audio Director"]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential sectors:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Film and OTT production"},{"text":"Music production"},{"text":"Recording studios"},{"text":"Television"},{"text":"Radio"},{"text":"Advertising"},{"text":"Podcast production"},{"text":"Live concerts"},{"text":"Events"},{"text":"Gaming"},{"text":"Animation"},{"text":"Theatre"},{"text":"Corporate media"},{"text":"Audiobook production"},{"text":"Broadcast"},{"text":"Post-production studios"}]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Core Learning","Practical Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Acoustics, sound fundamentals, electronics, music fundamentals"},{"text":"Microphones, cables, basic recording"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Recording, DAWs, editing, mixing"},{"text":"Pro Tools/Logic/Ableton/Reaper, EQ, compression"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Studio, live sound, film audio, post-production"},{"text":"Multitrack recording, Foley, dialogue editing, live mixing"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Advanced mixing, mastering, sound design, project management"},{"text":"Professional portfolio, complete audio productions"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Audio Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sound waves"},{"text":"Frequency"},{"text":"Amplitude"},{"text":"Wavelength"},{"text":"Decibels"},{"text":"Human hearing"},{"text":"Psychoacoustics"},{"text"